      "source": "<a href=\"ChromaVectorStore.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chroma.vectorstore\"><code>ChromaVectorStore</code></a> is a concrete implementation of the <a href=\"../../vectorstore/VectorStore.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.vectorstore\"><code>VectorStore</code></a>\ninterface. It is responsible for adding, deleting, and searching documents based on\ntheir similarity to a query, using the <a href=\"ChromaApi.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.ai.chroma.vectorstore\"><code>ChromaApi</code></a> and <a href=\"../../embedding/EmbeddingModel.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.ai.embedding\"><code>EmbeddingModel</code></a> for\nembedding calculations. For more information about how it does this, see the official\n<a href=\"https://www.trychroma.com/\">Chroma website</a>.",
      "translation": "`ChromaVectorStore` 是 `VectorStore` 接口的具体实现，负责根据文档与查询的相似度来添加、删除和搜索文档。它利用 `ChromaApi` 和 `EmbeddingModel` 进行嵌入计算。有关其工作原理的更多信息，请参阅官方 <a href=\"https://www.trychroma.com/\">Chroma 网站</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
